I’m Klaudjo, a software engineer based in Athens. For the past 7 years, I’ve been building apps people enjoy using, from the first screen to the database behind it.

I work with TypeScript, React, React Native, Vue, and Next.js, backed by Node.js and PostgreSQL. The tools change; my focus stays on thoughtful design, accessibility, and fast, reliable apps.

Outside of work, I build things of my own. My latest project is [Pickle Poll](https://picklepoll.app) - create a poll, share a link, and watch the votes come in live.
